{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTG, a game with cryptic name (&quot;ray-traced game&quot;, &quot;radioisotope thermoelectric generator&quot;), is a sci-fi puzzle/platformer with very unusual rendering method: CPU based ray-tracing. In time of writing of this text, there's no other game currently available using such method, at least not to my knowledge. <br><br>Dive into strange world, where initially, nothing makes sense. Chew through gradually more challenging puzzles and unravel what's going on, piece by piece, by accessing terminals scattered through the game.<br><br>Core gameplay of the game is puzzling, but there's also a touch of arcading, all of that intertwined with sci-fi story, resulting in one unusual indie game experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032050?t=1762381341","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032050?t=1762381341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032050/e66e56a489957fdbea8cece011039c714f972d31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762381341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032050/e66e56a489957fdbea8cece011039c714f972d31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762381341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTG, a game with cryptic name (&quot;ray-traced game&quot;, &quot;radioisotope thermoelectric generator&quot;), is a sci-fi puzzle/platformer with very unusual rendering method: CPU based ray-tracing. In time of writing of this text, there's no other game currently available using such method, at least not to my knowledge. <br><br>Dive into strange world, where initially, nothing makes sense. Chew through gradually more challenging puzzles and unravel what's going on, piece by piece, by accessing terminals scattered through the game.<br><br>Core gameplay of the game is puzzling, but there's also a touch of arcading, all of that intertwined with sci-fi story, resulting in one unusual indie game experience.</p>","developers":["VDApps"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032050/4f7b24744cd5a886a15a8eb897233cee62cff3f5/header.jpg?t=1762381341","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"RTG","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Zen 3+ , Intel 12th+ gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["VDApps"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032050/69db4f825b380a0a9a49ff43099f211d1e0e8399/ss_69db4f825b380a0a9a49ff